BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230627T092704Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nNavigating healthcare costs: Shield plans\, coverage 
	and claims\nSynopsis\n:\nCome find out more about health care costs in Sin
	gapore\n- How do I know if I can claim from my shield plan? What are some 
	of the common ones?\n- What are some of the new cancer coverage changes an
	d their impacts on policy holders?\n- How are premiums of IPs going to cha
	nge due the introduction of cancer drug list?\nSpeaker\n:\nHelen Shen from
	 Singlife\nShawn Lee\nModerator\n:\nDesiree Pei Fern LOW \nJoining Instruc
	tions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using
	 DBS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.
	mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/
	EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to t
	he event. This will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for
	 optimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this
	 hyperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID
	=ebba34ae8cf4954e99a3843031f5d5b75> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name
	\, Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.
		Download Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nCli
	ck on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2515 914 8254\n2.	Input Passwor
	d 1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore
	)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumba
	i)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2515 914 8
	254\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MT
	ID=e1be1d7fb8cf19dadf242f64798d49372> \n \n \n \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230721T125000
